                                Siêu phẩm <b>@tweetProd1.TenHh</b> vừa đáp cánh tại hệ thống với số lượng giới hạn.<br><br>
                                Giá cực tốt chỉ: <b>$@tweetProd1.DonGia</b><br>
                                Đừng bỏ lỡ ưu đãi hoàn tiền và giao hàng siêu tốc trong ngày.<br><br>
                                Click để săn ngay: <a href="/" class="text-primary text-decoration-none">quamonhai.vn</a> #QuaMonHai #TechDeal
                            </div>
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(tweetProd1.Hinh))
                            {
                                <div class="tweet-media-container">
                                    <img src="~/img/Hinh/HangHoa/@tweetProd1.Hinh" class="tweet-image" alt="@tweetProd1.TenHh">
                                </div>
                            }
                            <div class="tweet-actions">
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-regular fa-comment"></i> <span>12</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn" onclick="retweet(this, 35)"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> <span class="rt-count">35</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn" onclick="likeTweet(this, 128)"><i class="fa-regular fa-heart"></i> <span class="like-count">128</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple"></i> <span>10.5K</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    @if (Model.Count > 1)
                    {
                        var tweetProd2 = Model[1];
                        <!-- Tweet 2 -->
                        <div class="tweet-card">
                            <div class="tweet-avatar">Q</div>
                            <div class="flex-fill">
                                <div class="tweet-header">
                                    <span class="tweet-author">QuaMonHai <i class="fa fa-circle-check text-primary fs-6" style="color: #1d9bf0 !important;"></i></span>
                                    <span class="tweet-handle">@("@QuaMonHai")</span>
                                    <span class="text-muted">•</span>
                                    <span class="tweet-time text-muted">18h</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="tweet-text">
                                    Mùa hè này, hãy làm mới không gian làm việc và phong cách cá nhân của bạn cùng <b>@tweetProd2.TenHh</b>!<br><br>
                                    Đang áp dụng chương trình trả góp 0% lãi suất cùng quà tặng tai nghe Bluetooth độc quyền chỉ có tại cửa hàng QuaMonHai Biên Hòa.<br><br>
                                    Chi tiết sản phẩm: <a href="/" class="text-primary text-decoration-none">quamonhai.vn</a>
                                </div>
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(tweetProd2.Hinh))
                                {
                                    <div class="tweet-media-container">
                                        <img src="~/img/Hinh/HangHoa/@tweetProd2.Hinh" class="tweet-image" alt="@tweetProd2.TenHh">
                                    </div>
                                }
                                <div class="tweet-actions">
                                    <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-regular fa-comment"></i> <span>8</span></div>
                                    <div class="tweet-action-btn" onclick="retweet(this, 14)"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> <span class="rt-count">14</span></div>
                                    <div class="tweet-action-btn" onclick="likeTweet(this, 75)"><i class="fa-regular fa-heart"></i> <span class="like-count">75</span></div>
                                    <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple"></i> <span>5.4K</span></div>
                                    <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    }

                    <!-- Tweet 3 (No Image) -->
                    <div class="tweet-card">
                        <div class="tweet-avatar">Q</div>
                        <div class="flex-fill">
                            <div class="tweet-header">
                                <span class="tweet-author">QuaMonHai <i class="fa fa-circle-check text-primary fs-6" style="color: #1d9bf0 !important;"></i></span>
                                <span class="tweet-handle">@("@QuaMonHai")</span>
                                <span class="text-muted">•</span>
                                <span class="tweet-time text-muted">23 May</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="tweet-text">
                                📞 BẠN CẦN TRỢ GIÚP? Đội ngũ support tận tình của QuaMonHai luôn sẵn sàng phục vụ 24/7.<br><br>
                                🌟 Hotline/Zalo: 0936 363 636<br>
                                ✉️ Email: quamonhai@gmail.com<br>
                                Hoặc chat trực tiếp trực tiếp trên website <a href="/" class="text-primary text-decoration-none">quamonhai.vn</a> nhé! Hân hạnh được đón tiếp.
                            </div>
                            <div class="tweet-actions">
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-regular fa-comment"></i> <span>4</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn" onclick="retweet(this, 9)"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> <span class="rt-count">9</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn" onclick="likeTweet(this, 41)"><i class="fa-regular fa-heart"></i> <span class="like-count">41</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple"></i> <span>3.2K</span></div>
                                <div class="tweet-action-btn"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            <!-- Right Sidebar Widgets -->
            <div class="col-3 x-sidebar-right d-none d-lg-block">
                <input type="text" class="x-search-right" placeholder="Tìm kiếm">

                <div class="x-widget-card">
                    <h3 class="x-widget-title">What's happening</h3>
                    <div class="trend-item">
                        <div class="trend-category">Technology • Trending</div>
                        <div class="trend-name">#QuaMonHai</div>
                        <div class="trend-tweets">18.5K Tweets</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="trend-item">
                        <div class="trend-category">Shopping • Trending</div>
                        <div class="trend-name">#TechSale</div>
                        <div class="trend-tweets">84.2K Tweets</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="trend-item">
                        <div class="trend-category">Trending in Vietnam</div>
                        <div class="trend-name">Đồng Nai</div>
                        <div class="trend-tweets">12.8K Tweets</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="x-widget-card">
                    <h3 class="x-widget-title">Who to follow</h3>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <div class="rounded-circle bg-secondary text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; font-weight: bold;">T</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="fw-bold text-white" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.2;">TechNews</div>
                                <div class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">@("@technews")</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="btn btn-light btn-sm rounded-pill fw-bold px-3">Follow</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <div class="rounded-circle bg-success text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; font-weight: bold;">Q</div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="fw-bold text-white" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.2;">QuaMonHai</div>
                                <div class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">@("@quamonhai")</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="btn btn-light btn-sm rounded-pill fw-bold px-3">Follow</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function toggleFollow() {
            const btn = document.getElementById("btn-follow");
            const countSpan = document.getElementById("followers-count");
            
            if (btn.innerText === "Follow") {
                btn.innerText = "Following";
                btn.style.backgroundColor = "transparent";
                btn.style.color = "#e7e9ea";
                btn.style.borderColor = "#536471";
                countSpan.innerText = "45.3K";
            } else {
                btn.innerText = "Follow";
                btn.style.backgroundColor = "#e7e9ea";
                btn.style.color = "#0f1419";
                btn.style.borderColor = "transparent";
                countSpan.innerText = "45.2K";
            }
        }

        function likeTweet(btn, initialCount) {
            const countSpan = btn.querySelector('.like-count');
            const icon = btn.querySelector('i');
            
            if (btn.classList.contains('liked')) {
                btn.classList.remove('liked');
                icon.className = 'fa-regular fa-heart';
                countSpan.innerText = initialCount;
            } else {
                btn.classList.add('liked');
                icon.className = 'fa-solid fa-heart';
                countSpan.innerText = initialCount + 1;
            }
        }

        function retweet(btn, initialCount) {
            const countSpan = btn.querySelector('.rt-count');
            
            if (btn.classList.contains('retweeted')) {
                btn.classList.remove('retweeted');
                countSpan.innerText = initialCount;
            } else {
                btn.classList.add('retweeted');
                countSpan.innerText = initialCount + 1;
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
